{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobxKBES2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんってどんな人？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob4leTQ0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはアイドル唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYKvGkY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これもアイドル唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobswAuQQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはスーパーアイドル唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5tzF5R.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは「さすがに撮りすぎちゃう？」\nのバラエティ唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "基本私に向けてくれる顔はこっちかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもライブで目が合うと\nキラキラ笑顔で見つめてくれる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特にいつかのBACKS LIVE！！の\n何ラブの1A？の手をパンパンするところの唯衣ちゃんとペアでやってたあの時の表情忘れられないな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobAyFIkZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはハイセンス唯衣ちゃん（イジってます）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEZrHaI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはいのちゅけの唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobCfMe9A.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは妹唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob78cKC9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんの頭って触りたくなるよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpWBuuQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは外番組一緒だと心強い唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「くりぃむナンタラ」さん\n何度も一緒に出演させていただいたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「太田上田」さんも一緒に出演させていただけて嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の上田さんへの愛の熱弁も\nいつも真剣に聞いてくれて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと上田さんも沼のこと好きだよ！って\nいつも言ってくれて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まるで学生時代によくある\n友達が背中押してくれるあれで\n楽しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobsYTJ0B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpVtZGS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYTuKOd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobPYrOIr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobdF3Msf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobyaF62s.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobvtjx7B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツは本当に青春だ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "必死に駆け抜けてきた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobISE7wX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはやりきったってスッキリした顔の唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/moblTP01x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も唯衣ちゃんへの気持ちぜーんぶ詰め込んだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひサクラミーツみてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バラエティプロで面白すぎる唯衣ちゃんも\nライブでのイケ散らかし唯衣ちゃんも\n疲れてる時赤ちゃんみたいな唯衣ちゃんも\nぜーんぶ好きだった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業おめでとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しいよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後に"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobKkftdj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは世界一可愛い唯衣ちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯一無二の最高のセレモニーだったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃん大好き"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あきぽ🐟"}], "source": "official"}